# Save/load stage 2 (tests/save/save_continue.toml): a new process with stage 1's saves. Title, storage
# message, main menu: Down to CONTINUE, then the saved character; Return until the player has control.
# Press START; the storage message: the first confirm makes the game look for its saves (enumerate, then
# open the package with OPEN_EXISTING), the second closes the message; then Down to CONTINUE.
# Menu confirmations use "press" (held 4 frames), as a player would.
500 tap Return
700 press Return
850 press Return
1000 press Down
1050 capture main_menu
1100 press Return
1250 capture continue_list
1300 repeat 60 until gameplay press Return

# The same readings as before saving
@gameplay+300 capture loaded_play
@gameplay+400 tap Tab
@gameplay+480 capture status_loaded
@gameplay+500 tap C
@gameplay+580 capture equipment2_loaded
@gameplay+600 tap C
@gameplay+680 capture equipment3_loaded
@gameplay+700 tap Z
@gameplay+730 tap Z
@gameplay+800 tap PageDown
@gameplay+880 capture inventory_loaded
@gameplay+900 tap Escape
@gameplay+980 tap Escape

# A second change and save, for the reload and interrupted-save scenarios: equip a potion in the RB slot
# again (Items tab, Down to RB, Change Item, select the first entry), then save. With the slot empty, Change
# Item lists the inventory without an Unequip row, usable items first; save_new's White Potions are always
# there, and the random loot of its fight may put a Small Red Potion before them (K24). Either potion is a
# change of the RB slot; the reload compares with what this run saved.
@gameplay+1080 tap Tab
@gameplay+1160 tap C
@gameplay+1220 press Down
@gameplay+1280 press Return
@gameplay+1420 press Return
@gameplay+1500 capture equipment2_resaved
@gameplay+1520 tap Z
@gameplay+1600 capture status_resaved
@gameplay+1620 tap Escape
@gameplay+1700 tap Escape
@gameplay+1800 tap Down
@gameplay+1830 tap Down
@gameplay+1860 tap Down
@gameplay+1890 tap Down
@gameplay+1920 tap Down
@gameplay+1980 capture quit_selected
@gameplay+2000 press Return
@gameplay+2090 capture save_question
@gameplay+2120 press Return
@gameplay+2470 capture title_after_save
